e hunters, Eliza's capture and Panja's death. Kimba is born and escapes back to Africa. All this told without a single word spoken. The style of the Symphonic Poem's animation is unique. It draws heavily on the style of the 1989 TV series, but Kimba looks different from the way he looked in any other production.<br><br>\n(Source: kimbawlion.com/verspage.htm)","duration":51,"endDate":{"day":4,"month":1,"year":1991},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Adventure"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":62,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[],"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":1991,"source":null,"startDate":{"day":4,"month":1,"year":1991},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":3,"score":10},{"amount":7,"score":20},{"amount":8,"score":30},{"amount":6,"score":40},{"amount":16,"score":50},{"amount":14,"score":60},{"amount":25,"score":70},{"amount":41,"score":80},{"amount":2,"score":90},{"amount":4,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":18,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":203,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":211,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":33,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":4,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[[200,"Tezuka Productions",false,true],[11,"MADHOUSE",false,true],[323,"Nippon Columbia",false,false]],"synonyms":[],"title":{"english":null,"native":"アニメ交響詩 ジャングル大帝","romaji":"Anime Koukyoushi: Jungle Taitei"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793711244},"13051":{"al":13051,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":"#d6861a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/13051.jpg"},"description":"A mix of animation and live-action.","duration":30,"endDate":{"day":16,"month":8,"year":1989},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Hentai"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":37,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":1989,"source":null,"startDate":{"day":16,"month":8,"year":1989},"stats":{"scor